WEBVTT

00:19.820 --> 00:24.091
Tozasareta kioku no
naka no kizu ga

00:24.091 --> 00:28.629
Oto mo naku kokoro
ni fureru toki ni

00:28.629 --> 00:36.470
Yasashiku hohoemu sono ura
ni wa kodoku no namida

00:36.470 --> 00:41.275
Hateshinai tsuyosa motomete

00:41.275 --> 00:52.086
Shinjiru monotachi to
nando mo kakeagare

00:52.086 --> 00:54.121
Mamoritai

00:54.121 --> 00:56.457
Shinjitai

00:56.457 --> 01:00.794
Egao no wake wo subete

01:00.794 --> 01:05.165
Hageshisa mo itoshisa mo

01:05.165 --> 01:09.370
Zenbu uketomeru yo

01:09.370 --> 01:12.973
Nidoto sono te wo hanasanai

01:12.973 --> 01:21.472
Ano hikari wo mezashite...

01:31.225 --> 01:34.422
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:37.431 --> 01:39.299
If you complain that much,

01:39.299 --> 01:43.137
just tell me your name
and I'll call you that?

01:43.137 --> 01:46.273
A name is something
that has a special meaning.

01:46.273 --> 01:47.797
You can't give it out
carelessly.

01:48.509 --> 01:50.444
It must be really tough...

01:50.444 --> 01:53.881
Being the grandson of the
famous Abe no Seimei.

01:53.881 --> 01:55.816
No, it's not.

01:55.816 --> 02:00.082
I hear your two older brothers
are very talented as well.

02:01.288 --> 02:04.658
All living things
undergo changes.

02:04.658 --> 02:08.629
Trees and flowers change
their shape when it's time.

02:08.629 --> 02:11.932
The same theory applies
to people's hearts.

02:11.932 --> 02:15.669
That is true even for those
in a family of deities.

02:15.669 --> 02:17.671
Guren is no exception.

02:17.671 --> 02:20.765
We are here now because of all
the misunderstandings we had.

02:22.643 --> 02:25.806
Nobody Knows That Reason

02:28.048 --> 02:30.584
I wonder if I can
finish this today.

02:30.584 --> 02:32.352
If I get back late,

02:32.352 --> 02:35.255
I won't have time for
a nap before my patrol.

02:35.255 --> 02:38.158
Can't you take a day off
from patrolling?

02:38.158 --> 02:40.160
Things have been
rather quiet here...

02:40.160 --> 02:42.162
after the guardsman
was delivered.

02:42.162 --> 02:44.998
Precisely. It's been too quiet.

02:44.998 --> 02:49.269
Kazane's not likely to have
given up and gone away...

02:49.269 --> 02:51.939
- That's true.
- Masahiro.

02:51.939 --> 02:55.306
- Yes?
- Dr. Abe wants to see you.

02:55.809 --> 02:57.299
My father?

03:01.148 --> 03:04.879
- May I come in?
- Masahiro! Please come in.

03:05.552 --> 03:07.387
Is something the matter?

03:07.387 --> 03:11.125
Oh no. I just wanted you to
run a small errand for me.

03:11.125 --> 03:12.126
Sure.

03:12.126 --> 03:15.596
Could you drop by Narichika's
place when you go home?

03:15.596 --> 03:19.293
Brother's house?
When did he get back!

03:20.901 --> 03:22.636
You mean Lord Narichika?

03:22.636 --> 03:27.341
Yes, he'd been away from the capital
for a while because of his work.

03:27.341 --> 03:30.077
But he moved back yesterday.

03:30.077 --> 03:31.979
He's apparently
a brilliant person...

03:31.979 --> 03:34.348
who became a Calendar Master
at a young age.

03:34.348 --> 03:35.749
Yes.

03:35.749 --> 03:38.919
They say he's lucky as he
married into a powerful family.

03:38.919 --> 03:41.288
His father-in-law is a councilor!

03:41.288 --> 03:45.058
A person's achievements don't
always depend on connections.

03:45.058 --> 03:47.094
He must be very talented.

03:47.094 --> 03:51.031
Masahiro's other elder brother,
Lord Masachika,

03:51.031 --> 03:53.767
has an impressive ability
to read the stars.

03:53.767 --> 03:55.802
Well, they're descendents
of the Abe family.

03:55.802 --> 03:58.839
They can't be compared
to normal onmyouji.

03:58.839 --> 04:02.409
Both of you sure know a lot
about the Abe family.

04:02.409 --> 04:06.113
We used to baby-sit their kids
when they were young.

04:06.113 --> 04:09.082
In fact, we practically
brought up Yoshimasa.

04:09.082 --> 04:12.051
Wow! Even Lord Yoshimasa?

04:12.619 --> 04:16.590
That was the period when
Seimei had just lost Wakana.

04:16.590 --> 04:19.560
He buried himself in his work
to forget his grief.

04:19.560 --> 04:23.497
- Who's Lady Wakana?
- She was Master Seimei's wife.

04:23.497 --> 04:26.633
She is grandmother to Masahiro.

04:26.633 --> 04:28.168
I see...

04:28.168 --> 04:33.207
You know a lot as you've been with
Master Seimei for such a long time.

04:33.207 --> 04:37.044
It may seem like a very
long time ago to humans.

04:37.044 --> 04:39.813
But to us, it seems like
it was just yesterday.

04:39.813 --> 04:43.817
Yoshimasa, the little boy
we raised, has three sons.

04:43.817 --> 04:48.720
And now, both Lord Narichika
and Lord Masachika are fathers.

04:59.433 --> 05:02.436
Come to me, swift and certain.
Divine hands of the deity.

05:02.436 --> 05:05.706
Conquer the wild shadows
of the evil ones.

05:05.706 --> 05:08.542
If this continues, the barrier
will be destroyed.

05:08.542 --> 05:12.706
This is dreadful. I was never
very good at exorcism.

05:17.684 --> 05:22.053
It seems like my brother's being
attacked by some evil spirit.

05:23.257 --> 05:26.493
That's why Yoshimasa told us
to check on Narichika.

05:26.493 --> 05:28.552
He's really sharp.

05:36.403 --> 05:38.071
Mokkun!

05:38.071 --> 05:41.942
- I can't... go in there.
- What are you talking about?

05:41.942 --> 05:45.776
- I'm not going in.
- Why not, Mokkun?

05:46.546 --> 05:48.241
Come on, let's go!

05:50.751 --> 05:52.386
Heed my sincere prayers.

05:52.386 --> 05:54.254
And descend,
you heavenly hosts.

05:54.254 --> 05:58.247
Bind the evil, destroy
a hundred ghosts. Defend me!

06:00.994 --> 06:03.360
That was my last talisman...

06:06.300 --> 06:07.892
Brother!

06:10.304 --> 06:12.105
Hidden warriors,
formidable soldiers!

06:12.105 --> 06:14.835
Assemble and take formation
against the enemy!

06:15.776 --> 06:18.178
[chant]

06:18.178 --> 06:19.907
Hey, you!

06:24.051 --> 06:26.019
You can't get away!

06:36.296 --> 06:39.197
Mokkun... He let it escape!

06:40.267 --> 06:43.337
- Uncle Masahiro!
- Uncle Masahiro, you're strong!

06:43.337 --> 06:46.773
Were you guys scared?
Kunishige, Tadamoto.

06:46.773 --> 06:48.709
Don't worry,
everything's fine.

06:48.709 --> 06:51.912
You came just in time!
I'm so glad you're here!

06:51.912 --> 06:56.781
Father had a bad feeling,
so he asked me to visit you.

06:57.217 --> 07:00.754
Your powers have grown stronger
since the last time we met.

07:00.754 --> 07:05.792
Not really. I've let
the demon escape.

07:05.792 --> 07:10.330
You don't see many demons that
can move that quickly.

07:10.330 --> 07:12.799
Is everything okay now?

07:12.799 --> 07:15.969
The monster's left.
You can rest easy for now.

07:15.969 --> 07:17.630
Thank goodness.

07:28.682 --> 07:32.919
Mokkun! Why didn't you
come with me?

07:32.919 --> 07:34.721
Because you weren't there...

07:34.721 --> 07:39.090
Sorry. I tried to catch it
when it came out, but...

07:40.527 --> 07:43.894
Well, my brother and his family
aren't hurt, so it's fine.

07:57.677 --> 08:00.976
What's wrong? Are you hurt
or something?

08:02.983 --> 08:07.020
- I'm home!
- Welcome back, Masahiro.

08:07.020 --> 08:08.688
You're late today.

08:08.688 --> 08:11.658
Yeah, I was running
an errand for my father.

08:11.658 --> 08:13.760
Oh? Where's Mokkun?

08:13.760 --> 08:16.991
Hm? He was just with me
at the gate.

08:30.610 --> 08:33.580
I wonder what Touda's doing...

08:33.580 --> 08:38.819
It's unusual for Touda
to be apart from Masahiro.

08:38.819 --> 08:42.589
To me, he looks depressed...

08:42.589 --> 08:44.424
Touda's depressed?

08:44.424 --> 08:48.228
No way!
He's always like that.

08:48.228 --> 08:51.026
Sulky and unfriendly.

08:57.938 --> 08:59.639
What's wrong?

08:59.639 --> 09:02.676
Kou... It's rare for you.

09:02.676 --> 09:06.079
You don't usually come out
unless Seimei summons you.

09:06.079 --> 09:09.742
No, I'll come out
if I feel like it.

09:11.985 --> 09:14.419
You look down in the dumps.

09:14.588 --> 09:16.783
I always look like this.

09:17.924 --> 09:19.585
Oh yeah?

09:21.495 --> 09:23.725
I don't like children.

09:24.531 --> 09:26.466
They cry so easily.

09:26.466 --> 09:29.803
And they continue to cry
until they run a fever.

09:29.803 --> 09:34.035
They're weak.
That's why I hate them.

09:36.009 --> 09:40.013
I heard that Narichika's daughter
was targeted by a demon.

09:40.013 --> 09:41.414
Right.

09:41.414 --> 09:44.651
I also heard you refused
to enter the house...

09:44.651 --> 09:47.518
and let the demon escape.

09:48.622 --> 09:50.924
It's all my fault.

09:50.924 --> 09:53.593
This isn't like you, Touda.

09:53.593 --> 09:55.595
It moved really fast.

09:55.595 --> 09:58.698
A large creature like that
moved like the wind.

09:58.698 --> 10:02.736
But you still found out
what kind of demon it was?

10:02.736 --> 10:05.772
A Hihi. I could smell
the blood...

10:05.772 --> 10:09.299
It ate a few humans earlier.
That's why it was so strong.

10:10.310 --> 10:11.912
A Hihi?

10:11.912 --> 10:14.648
Brother's created
another barrier.

10:14.648 --> 10:18.151
But they say Hihis don't give up
on their victim till the end.

10:18.151 --> 10:21.780
We have to eliminate
that hihi as soon as possible.

10:22.055 --> 10:25.025
Yes, and...

10:25.025 --> 10:26.788
What is it?

10:27.327 --> 10:30.597
- Mokkun seems weird.
- Guren does?

10:30.597 --> 10:32.966
He refused to enter
Narichika's house...

10:32.966 --> 10:35.168
although Kohime was
in danger.

10:35.168 --> 10:36.836
Oh?

10:36.836 --> 10:39.673
I somehow managed
to reach there in time,

10:39.673 --> 10:43.810
but Mokkun IS the quickest
one, so... Ouch!

10:43.810 --> 10:48.348
Both Narichika and you were there.
Why need Guren?

10:48.348 --> 10:53.153
You two better handle
one Hihi easily by yourselves!

10:53.153 --> 10:55.488
Well, yeah, I guess...

10:55.488 --> 10:58.491
But Mokkun was acting...

10:58.491 --> 11:02.154
Don't worry about it.
Touda was just overreacting.

11:03.630 --> 11:05.495
What's wrong, Masahiro?

11:06.433 --> 11:09.569
- Another shikigami...
- Oh, it's Kouchin.

11:09.569 --> 11:12.936
You haven't met her before,
have you, Masahiro?

11:13.506 --> 11:18.345
Well, I've known you since a baby so
it doesn't feel like the first time.

11:18.345 --> 11:22.849
Masahiro, take Guren, Rikugou
and Kouchin with you...

11:22.849 --> 11:25.885
and go get rid of it
quickly this time.

11:25.885 --> 11:27.887
You want me to go now?

11:27.887 --> 11:30.624
Hihis are nocturnal creatures.

11:30.624 --> 11:34.993
And if it's hungry,
it'll come back again tonight.

11:35.028 --> 11:39.099
- Oh, all right then.
- You don't sound very keen.

11:39.099 --> 11:42.102
Well, Mokkun's not
his usual self tonight,

11:42.102 --> 11:45.405
so I don't know if we should
try again so soon.

11:45.405 --> 11:48.708
I told you.
Don't worry about him.

11:48.708 --> 11:50.107
Let's get Touda.

11:57.651 --> 12:01.054
I'm not going into that house
no matter what.

12:01.054 --> 12:04.424
You expect me to capture
that Hihi on my own?

12:04.424 --> 12:06.426
You've got Rikugou
and Kou with you.

12:06.426 --> 12:09.763
What? You've always
called Rikugou, "Rikugou".

12:09.763 --> 12:12.197
But why do you call
Kouchin, "Kou"?

12:13.199 --> 12:15.602
Have you nothing better to do?

12:15.602 --> 12:17.337
What do you mean by that?

12:17.337 --> 12:20.707
You always tell me about
the importance of names.

12:20.707 --> 12:23.141
How can you brush me off
like that?

12:23.710 --> 12:26.646
Why don't you just worry
about Kohime!

12:26.646 --> 12:28.273
But!

12:55.442 --> 12:59.071
Hey, let me go!
I'm not an animal!

13:05.185 --> 13:08.788
Kouchin! You and Mokkun
stay with Kohime.

13:08.788 --> 13:10.380
All right.

13:15.762 --> 13:18.856
- Rikugou!
- Long time no see.

13:23.670 --> 13:26.639
- Brother!
- Thanks for coming, Masahiro!

13:26.639 --> 13:29.008
You attack while
I'll try to distract it.

13:29.008 --> 13:30.737
Yes!

13:31.778 --> 13:33.302
Bound!

13:34.948 --> 13:38.577
[chant]

13:47.994 --> 13:50.485
Kou! Cut it out!

13:50.930 --> 13:54.868
- Are you afraid of children?
- I'm not afraid. I just hate them.

13:54.868 --> 13:57.036
I'll go help Masahiro.

13:57.036 --> 14:00.840
There's a barrier here, so you
should be fine on your own.

14:00.840 --> 14:02.239
Really!

14:05.478 --> 14:08.414
It brought along
reinforcements.

14:08.414 --> 14:10.712
You take one, Touda!

14:18.792 --> 14:21.226
It's not easy when
there're so many of them.

14:25.131 --> 14:26.966
That one must be
the leader.

14:26.966 --> 14:29.135
We have to stop him!

14:29.135 --> 14:31.070
Go forth to a destination
yet unseen...

14:31.070 --> 14:32.662
Be careful!

14:34.307 --> 14:38.209
[chant]

14:39.145 --> 14:41.375
No! The leader's!

14:55.094 --> 14:57.230
That thing wrecked the barrier!

14:57.230 --> 14:59.399
- Mother!
- Don't worry.

14:59.399 --> 15:02.068
Your father will protect us.

15:02.068 --> 15:05.572
- Mokkun, take care of it!
- It's Uncle Masahiro!

15:05.572 --> 15:07.938
He came to help us!

15:11.778 --> 15:14.804
- Mokkun, protect the family.
- I'll fight right here!

15:21.020 --> 15:22.578
Kohime!

15:32.265 --> 15:34.165
Touda! What are you doing?!

15:42.275 --> 15:45.369
It's my fault.
I will get her back!

15:48.548 --> 15:51.718
Go forth to a destination yet
unseen. Slow down their steps...

15:51.718 --> 15:53.709
[chant]

15:54.087 --> 15:55.855
Hidden warriors,
formidable soldiers!

15:55.855 --> 15:58.016
Assemble and take formation
against the enemy!

16:00.226 --> 16:02.362
Masahiro, the others have
been taken care of.

16:02.362 --> 16:05.565
- I'll go after Touda.
- I'm coming with you!

16:05.565 --> 16:07.999
Rikugou, take care of
the others!

16:33.059 --> 16:35.295
When you get down to it...

16:35.295 --> 16:39.925
This predicament...
is all because...

16:43.069 --> 16:45.196
of you!

16:55.381 --> 16:57.645
Looks like we're not needed.

16:58.251 --> 17:00.920
I'm so glad everyone is safe!

17:00.920 --> 17:04.223
- Father!
- Sumiko, are you all right?

17:04.223 --> 17:05.952
I'm fine.

17:06.926 --> 17:09.662
Touda managed to get
Kohime back.

17:09.662 --> 17:12.631
Really? That's a relief.

17:16.469 --> 17:17.737
Guren.

17:17.737 --> 17:20.763
- Can you take this?
- Yeah.

17:21.941 --> 17:24.910
Everything's all right
now, Kohime.

17:29.449 --> 17:31.280
Thank you, Guren.

17:32.885 --> 17:35.154
I was the one who
created the mess.

17:35.154 --> 17:39.488
But why did you insist on
staying out of the house?

17:41.561 --> 17:44.931
- Really!
- Because he can't stand it.

17:44.931 --> 17:47.400
You mean the baby?

17:47.400 --> 17:50.426
- Kou!
- Is that true, Mokkun?

17:52.372 --> 17:56.275
- Hold it, Touda.
- Hey, Kou! Let me go!

17:56.275 --> 17:58.505
Don't walk away.

17:59.278 --> 18:02.515
Right, I don't like babies.

18:02.515 --> 18:07.043
They cry easily and they can't talk
so I don't know what they want.

18:10.189 --> 18:13.226
You just don't like
the babies' crying!

18:13.226 --> 18:16.095
Because you are afraid
that they don't like you.

18:16.095 --> 18:19.565
W-What are you...
Hey, stop that!

18:19.565 --> 18:23.160
Now, stop talking so loudly
or Kohime will start crying.

18:23.970 --> 18:26.268
Kohime, meet Mokkun.
Can you see him?

18:28.207 --> 18:31.802
Mokku... mokku...

18:41.521 --> 18:43.751
She's cute, isn't she?

18:44.123 --> 18:45.988
Can I go now?

18:47.260 --> 18:48.795
What's the matter, Kouchin?

18:48.795 --> 18:52.031
Masahiro, you really
live up to your name.

18:52.031 --> 18:53.931
What do you mean?

18:59.038 --> 19:00.440
Don't do that, Masahiro!

19:00.440 --> 19:02.874
You mustn't tear up
Seimei's talisman.

19:03.876 --> 19:07.437
Hey! Don't cause
trouble to others!

19:11.751 --> 19:14.652
Gui! Guu!

19:18.124 --> 19:20.093
The expression on
Touda's face...

19:20.093 --> 19:23.896
I had never seen it before...
Masahiro.

19:23.896 --> 19:25.488
Wait up! Mokkun!

19:29.268 --> 19:33.039
So who babysat Masahiro?

19:33.039 --> 19:36.309
I'd love to hear what he was
like when he was little.

19:36.309 --> 19:40.413
The one who took care of
Masahiro the most was...

19:40.413 --> 19:44.144
It's rather "still taking care of"
than "took care of."

19:45.051 --> 19:47.687
- Who is it?
- I'm telling you!

19:47.687 --> 19:50.556
How many times do I have to
tell you I hate babies?

19:50.556 --> 19:54.694
Stop acting!
Kohime was adorable, right?

19:54.694 --> 19:56.229
Hey now.

19:56.229 --> 19:59.031
We destroyed the Hihi,
so stop complaining.

19:59.031 --> 20:01.234
I am not complaining!

20:01.234 --> 20:07.662
I still feel strange to see
Touda like that.

20:08.608 --> 20:11.043
I don't blame you for that.

20:11.043 --> 20:12.945
Kouchin...

20:12.945 --> 20:16.816
His aura becomes softer and
gentler when he's with Masahiro.

20:16.816 --> 20:18.184
Yeah, it does.

20:18.184 --> 20:20.953
And when he turns into
that furry white creature,

20:20.953 --> 20:23.122
he isn't so scary looking
anymore.

20:23.122 --> 20:25.491
Even a baby smiled at him.

20:25.491 --> 20:28.561
- A baby smiled?
- No way!

20:28.561 --> 20:31.264
Time can change things.

20:31.264 --> 20:34.100
That theory applies to
both humans and shikigami.

20:34.100 --> 20:36.068
Seimei said the same thing.

20:36.068 --> 20:38.104
Hey!

20:38.104 --> 20:42.041
Do you guys want some rice cakes?
My brother gave me some.

20:42.041 --> 20:43.976
I could sure use
a snack now.

20:43.976 --> 20:46.945
And it's been some time
since we've had rice cakes.

20:47.146 --> 20:49.815
But we didn't do anything
to help.

20:49.815 --> 20:52.285
I'm sure it's okay.
He invited us!

20:52.285 --> 20:54.753
Come on, you guys!

20:56.189 --> 20:59.750
The shikigami are starting to see
Touda in a different light.

21:00.159 --> 21:02.828
And it's all thanks to
Masahiro.

21:02.828 --> 21:04.796
I won't forget!

21:05.631 --> 21:08.100
The sin that Touda committed.

21:08.100 --> 21:11.504
And if he makes
the same mistake...

21:11.504 --> 21:15.804
I swear...
Touda, I will...

21:16.275 --> 21:18.436
He won't try again.

21:19.412 --> 21:21.812
As long as he's with
Masahiro.

21:42.868 --> 21:54.347
Toki to shite hito wa dare mo
Yume wo miushinatte shimau

21:54.347 --> 22:05.658
Ayamachi ya kizutsukikata mo
Jidai wa kurikaesarete iku

22:05.658 --> 22:11.397
Doushite shinjiau koto ni aragauno?

22:11.397 --> 22:16.960
Doushite unmei to iu hikari kesuno?

22:19.272 --> 22:29.548
Bokutachi no mirai wa
Kono te de mamori nukitai

22:29.548 --> 22:36.455
Zenryoku de idomukoto no imi wo

22:36.455 --> 22:41.661
Kimi ga oshietekureta kara

22:41.661 --> 22:47.400
Motto motto kimi wa kimi o koete

22:47.400 --> 22:54.704
Kitto kitto kitto

22:59.879 --> 23:02.609
